  "name": "Manufacturer Onboarding And Risk Assessment Advisor DSHRZ",
  "description": "Our Manufacturer Onboarding And Risk Assessment Advisor provides the Design Engineer the information they need when entering the Manufacturer quality and certification requirements by simply asking questions. For example, questions can be about the quality certificates needed for compliance and the on-boarding steps. This eliminates the need to navigate to other webpages or download documents to get answers. Design Engineers can complete tasks faster resulting in a streamlined process.",
